A_660 - Among many other things, Osho said that the condom was the invention of the century. He said this without realizing that sperm is a resource that consumes not only precious chemicals, but also a bit of the spirit of the person who emits it. He also didn't understand that those who indulge in sex, as he himself did in the United States, later suffer the consequences. The sooner people get rid of the idea that sex is also for fun, the better.